    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Anticipatory bail allows a person who apprehends arrest to seek protection from the court before arrest occurs. This is general information only.</p>
      <p>Under the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, the relevant provisions are considered by the Sessions Court or High Court. Courts examine the nature of the accusation, antecedents, and likelihood of flight or interference with investigation.</p>
      <p>For specific matters, professional advice is necessary.</p>
